        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Isaiah Mustafa, Terry Crews, Stacy Keibler\n- Campaigns: Make a Smellmitment\n- TV Episodes: Chuck Versus the A-Team\n- Topics: acting, NFL, CIA operatives, Intersect\n\nFacts:\n- Isaiah Amir Mustafa was born on February 11, 1974.\n- Isaiah Mustafa is an American actor and former NFL practice squad wide receiver.\n- The \"Make a Smellmitment\" campaign retained much of the format from the previous campaign, including characters played by Isaiah Mustafa and Terry Crews.\n- In \"Chuck Versus the A-Team,\" Chuck fears that new CIA operatives played by Isaiah Mustafa and Stacy Keibler, who have downloaded the Intersect, will render him obsolete.",
